{
  "reply": "<h2>Ada's research</h2><p>Ada wrote a <strong>federated learning</strong> paper, see <a class=\"limmat-link\" href=\"/research/federated-learning-paper/\">the paper</a> and <a class=\"limmat-link\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Federated_learning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wikipedia</a>. It used <code class=\"limmat-inline-code\">FedAvg</code> with <em>non-IID</em> data.</p><h3>What was built</h3><ul class=\"limmat-list\"><li>A VS Code extension with <code class=\"limmat-inline-code\">fast</code> startup</li><li><em>Cloud</em> tooling at <strong>Acme</strong><ul class=\"limmat-list\"><li>nested bullet one</li><li>nested bullet two</li></ul></li><li>A chat assistant</li></ul><ol class=\"limmat-list\"><li>Read the paper</li><li>Run the code</li><li>Ask questions</li></ol><div class=\"limmat-table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Project</th><th>Role</th><th>Year</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Federated paper</td><td>Author</td><td>2024</td></tr><tr><td>VS Code extension</td><td>Maintainer</td><td>2023</td></tr><tr><td>Chat</td><td>Builder</td><td>2026</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Here is a snippet:</p><div class=\"limmat-code\"><div class=\"limmat-code-head\"><span class=\"limmat-lang\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ts</span><button class=\"limmat-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy ts\">Copy</button><span class=\"limmat-status\" role=\"status\"></span></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"limmat-lang-ts\">function add(a: number, b: number): number {\n  // a &lt; b &amp;&amp; c &gt; d\n  return a + b;\n}</code></pre></div><ul class=\"limmat-list\"><li class=\"limmat-task\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\" aria-label=\"Completed\">Ship the chat</li><li class=\"limmat-task\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Not completed\">Write more tests</li></ul><blockquote><p>Federated learning keeps data on device.</p></blockquote><p>That is <strong>all</strong> for now, see <a class=\"limmat-link\" href=\"https://example.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://example.com</a> for more.</p>",
